SUMMARY:Celebrate Davis 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join the Davis Chamber of Commerce in celebrating the 23rd year of Celebrate Davis. Celebrate Davis 2026 is scheduled for Friday\, May 15\, 2026\, from 5:30-9:30 pm at Community Park. Celebrate Davis is a long-running tradition highlights the city’s commitment to supporting local entrepreneurship while creating a fun\, welcoming space for the entire community. \n  \nBounce houses\, food trucks\, artists\, vendors\, train rides\, and endless fun packed in this one-night community celebration. The community festival highlights local businesses and community spirit. \n  \nIt is a member-only event. Membership provides valuable benefits and the opportunity to participate fully in this signature community event. If you are not a member\, email: \nCarrie Rohrbach: executive@davischamber.com \n  \nWhether you’re sampling local cuisine\, browsing small business booths\, or enjoying the festive atmosphere\, Celebrate Davis offers something for all ages. Visit the website for more details: https://web.davischamber.com/events/Celebrate-Davis-2026-5663/details
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/celebrate-davis-2/
LOCATION:Community Park\, 203 E 14th Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/tmp_13719_2-12-2026_52411_-e1777657190178.png
END:VEVENT
