LOCATION:City Hall Community Chambers\, 23 Russell Blvd\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/newmayor_ci_EVERETT_SMITH-scaled-e1777048191300.webp
